{"audit_run_id":"audit:82c85106871740efbcd9f0e49a91d3c5","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":87,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"A veterinary welfare trial on harness padding for working donkeys hauling brick carts."},{"end_column":83,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"48 adult working donkeys were each assessed once, after four weeks of normal work."},{"end_column":80,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"24 donkeys worked in a new closed-cell foam girth pad and 24 in the traditional"},{"end_column":23,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"sacking-wrapped girth."},{"end_column":80,"end_line":8,"start_column":1,"start_line":8,"text":"**One row is one donkey**: a single animal, with its harness group and the five"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"declared outcome measurements taken at that one assessment. There are 48 rows plus a"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"header row. Every donkey has a value for every outcome; there are no missing values."},{"end_column":32,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"| Column | Type | Description |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":112,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| `donkey_id` | text | Per-donkey identifier, `D01` through `D48`. One value per row, unique across the file. |"},{"end_column":181,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `girth_type` | text | Harness group. Exactly two values: `foam_pad` (closed-cell foam girth pad, 24 donkeys) and `sacking_wrap` (traditional sacking-wrapped girth, 24 donkeys). |"},{"end_column":137,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `lesion_score_pts` | integer | Girth-region skin lesion score, in points on a 0 to 5 integer scale. Higher means more lesion damage. |"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `hair_loss_cm2` | number | Area of hair loss in the girth region, in square centimetres. |"},{"end_column":205,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `nociceptive_threshold_n` | number | Mechanical nociceptive threshold at the girth region, in newtons: the pressure force at which the donkey first responds. Higher means less sensitivity to pressure. |"},{"end_column":123,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| `body_condition_pts` | number | Body condition score, in points on a 1 to 9 scale, recorded to the nearest half point. |"},{"end_column":104,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| `rectal_temp_c` | number | Rectal temperature 15 minutes after the working day, in degrees Celsius. |"},{"end_column":84,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"The five outcome columns appear in the order the trial declared them: lesion score,"},{"end_column":70,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"hair loss, nociceptive threshold, body condition, rectal temperature."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:f7f399b852c4c4a42092","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:bdac2e0b7c55d22ad823d59c330c709bb2e5814dbfe860b1e1b0f83d7765fb0c","end_line":25,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-25","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:82c85106871740efbcd9f0e49a91d3c5","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":97,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `girth_type` column of `girth_pad_trial.csv`."},{"end_column":151,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: lesion_score_pts, hair_loss_cm2, nociceptive_threshold_n, body_condition_pts, rectal_temp_c."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:08700b0485354b181c77","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:997ebed013b113591433a3be068e6377a890c1ae3a8f994b60f02fa23d37eb9c","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
